<text name="XFTL_ACH_CHONKESTREL_1_name">Blockade Breaker</text>
<text name="XFTL_ACH_CHONKESTREL_1_desc">Beat the RSV Vigilance at the Blockade Line with the Chonkestrel.</text>
<text name="XFTL_ACH_CHONKESTREL_2_name">Mainframe Down</text>
<text name="XFTL_ACH_CHONKESTREL_2_desc">Destroy CONCORD's Mainframe and win the game with the Chonkestrel.</text>
